}
else if(s==='look'){
h='<div class="card"><h2>👀 Super-power 1: Look</h2><p>Look closely at Larry’s forest. Take your time.</p><div class="scene" role="img" aria-label="A row of items: tree, apple, owl, moon, apple, star, apple, tree, owl">🌳🍎🦉🌙🍎⭐🍎🌳🦉</div><p><b>How many apples 🍎 do you see?</b></p>'+quiz('',['2','3','4'],1)+'<p class="tip">Grown-up tip: ask, “What else do you notice?” Looking carefully is the first step to learning.</p></div>';
app.innerHTML=h;wire(1);
}
else if(s==='listen'){
h='<div class="card"><h2>👂 Super-power 2: Listen</h2><p>Grown-up, read this short practice story out loud. Little dreamer, listen closely!</p><div class="read">Larry sat on a branch at night. First, he heard a soft rustle in the leaves. Then, he heard a tiny squeak. Last, he heard a drip of rain.</div><p><b>What did Larry hear first?</b></p>'+quiz('',['A tiny squeak','A soft rustle','A drip of rain'],1)+'<p class="tip">Grown-up tip: ask your child to retell the story in their own words.</p></div>';
app.innerHTML=h;wire(1);
}
else if(s==='learn'){
h='<div class="card"><h2>💡 Super-power 3: Learn</h2><p>When we look and listen, we learn! Now tell Larry about <i>your</i> dream.</p><label for="nx"><b>Something I want to learn next:</b></label><input id="nx" maxlength="80" placeholder="Type or ask a grown-up to help" value="'+esc(saved)+'"><button class="primary" id="fin">Finish lesson 🎉</button></div>';
